1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,309
Take a square sheet of tin, eighteen centimetres a side.

2
00:00:04,309 --> 00:00:09,388
Cut a small square from each corner and fold up the flaps: an open box.

3
00:00:09,388 --> 00:00:12,083
Cut too little and the box is shallow.

4
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:14,752
Cut too much and the base vanishes.

